============================================================================================
DOES IT TERMINATE
============================================================================================
  the previous engine deadlocked by locking a BOS at an all-history extreme.
  a phase held for thousands of bars is that failure; a few hundred is a quiet market.
  main  idle   112  track   113  seek    23  lock  3774
  int   idle   108  track  2172  seek  2172  lock  1527
  deep  idle   157  track  2172  seek    93  lock  2502

  farthest BOS ever locked, as a fraction of price at the time: 85.1%
  an unreachable level is the symptom; anything in single-digit percent is a real level.

============================================================================================
DO THE THREE DEPTHS ACTUALLY DIFFER
============================================================================================
  if Internal and Deep merely echo Main, the scope hierarchy is decorative.
  main   IDM published   1246   taken    600   BOS broken    280   flips    130   resets      0   reused PB   229
  int    IDM published   6999   taken   3088   BOS broken    332   flips    105   resets    410   reused PB   230
  deep   IDM published   7518   taken   3328   BOS broken    391   flips     94   resets    437   reused PB   269

============================================================================================
FIRST PASSAGE AFTER THE INDUCEMENT IS TAKEN
============================================================================================
  the model's central claim: inducement taken, then the move continues to the BOS
  more often than it turns and takes the CHoCH. bars touching both are excluded.
  main   BOS first   283 ( 70%)   CHoCH first   121 ( 30%)   ambiguous    0   n 404
  int    BOS first   227 ( 64%)   CHoCH first   130 ( 36%)   ambiguous    0   n 357
  deep   BOS first   250 ( 67%)   CHoCH first   122 ( 33%)   ambiguous    0   n 372

============================================================================================
WHAT HAPPENS TO EVERY BOS THAT IS LOCKED
============================================================================================
  'farthest' above is a headline without a denominator. a level far
  from price is only a bug if it STRANDS the engine - if it is
  superseded by the next IDM break it cost nothing.
    broke                                280 ( 47%)
    abandoned - CHoCH went first         127 ( 21%)
    superseded by a nearer one           185 ( 31%)
    STILL OPEN at window end               8 (  1%)

  distance from price when locked:  median 1.91%   p90 15.91%   p99 25.05%   max 27.69%
  bars to break, of those that broke:  median 54   p90 418   max 1966
  locked more than 10% away: 87 (14.5%) - 85 superseded, 0 broke, 1 abandoned, 1 stranded

============================================================================================
INSIDE BARS
============================================================================================
  31248 of 92152 bars inside a live mother range (34%); 5983 took out both sides at once (6.49%).
  the both-sides case is the one OHLC cannot order. it is counted rather than guessed.
